      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LOVEMETO NZ (3) chased along the sprint lane for third as favourite in the Maryborough Cup last start but should enjoy the return to this circuit having scored a Dullard Cup win and finished second in Group 1 Bill Collins Trotters Sprint in his previous two visits. It's been a while since he has attempted a standing start but he has performed well under those conditions before. HOPPY NZ (4) set a new track record when beating Lovemeto in the Maryborough Cup last start. Has only once missed a place in his last nine starts so he is consistent and is proven at the standing start. CRACKERJACK NZ (11) comes off some strong placings at the Brisbane winter carnival including the Great Square. Won the only time he raced here and has yet to miss a place when fresh. IM BOBBY (6) put the writing on the wall with his last-start second to Hoppy at Maryborough while IMPERIAL MONARCH NZ (7) has been consistent this time in so should be included.",
